# ============================================================
# ZyraxonOS — the real desktop environment
# XFCE4: a complete, mature desktop with a real start menu
# (Whisker Menu), a real taskbar (xfce4-panel), a real settings
# manager, a real file manager, a real window manager with a
# compositor (this is what makes true glass/blur possible).
# ============================================================
